  "route": "original",
  "notes": "Backlog game, all-AAA pass: picked from RAWG's most-added list for its year across all genres (docs/PLAN.md section 2, genre filter widened 2026-10-23). RAWG's first result is the expected entry (id 2166). The Steam app-list search found no match under this title, but RAWG's store list for this game links Steam app 330840, which was used; its schema returns an empty game name. RAWG lists six additions, \"Game of Thrones - Episode 1: Iron from Ice\" (2014-12-02) through \"Game of Thrones: Episode Six - The Ice Dragon\" (2015-11-17); the episode names in the chapter titles come from those. Each episode has eight Steam achievements: one for each of seven chapters and one for finishing the episode; none of the 48 is hidden, but the episode 3 to 6 chapters are spoiler-guarded anyway. StrategyWiki has no page under \"Game of Thrones (Telltale)\" or \"Game of Thrones: A Telltale Games Series\". telltale.fandom.com returned HTTP 404; gameofthrones.fandom.com answers the API under \"Game of Thrones: A Telltale Games Series\" with about 408 linked articles (a show wiki, so most links are about the show); names only were looked at, nothing copied. Steam app 208730 (store name \"Game of Thrones\", schema \"ValveTestApp208730\") was checked and not used: it has 50 achievements for 15 or more chapters, which does not match this six-episode game."
